    {
      "id": "a1f0c2d3-0001-4a01-9a01-vortexnotes1",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        -220
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Vortex feedback v2 → Plane\n\nLocal candidate — NOT PUBLISHED.\n\nSee files/vortex-intake/README.md for deployment, credentials, recovery and tests.\n\nSame public URL/token. JSON legacy + JSON v2; multipart payload + attachment.\nV2: only HTTP 200 completed after issue/attachment confirmation. Legacy JSON retains early202 (no delivery guarantee).\n\nPrivate adapter uses a SQLite ledger and a single-instance lock; client retains bytes on failure.\nConfigure Vortex Shared Secret and Vortex Intake Internal (X-Vortex-Intake-Token).\nNever enable blind HTTP retries.\n\nTelegram/email remain disabled and disconnected. Rewire only after successful completion, with independent failure handling.",
        "width": 720,
        "height": 380
      }
    },
